# silently cover a pen nobody declared. `bio-plane/test/nc-coff12.mjs` writes its
# per-arm pristine copies of `src/index.mjs` here.
.coff12-control-pristine/

# REC-105's control pen and its pristine origin/main baseline checkout, each named
